{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07492","headline":"送贾三北游 · 刘长卿","name":"送贾三北游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾生未达犹窘迫，身驰匹马邯郸陌。\n片云郊外遥送人，斗酒城边暮留客。\n顾予他日仰时髦，不堪此别相思劳。\n雨色新添漳水绿，夕阳远照苏门高。\n把袂相看衣共缁，穷愁只是惜良时。\n亦知到处逢下榻，莫滞秋风西上期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}